### List events (first page, ordered by start time)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events

### Filter by category
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?category=MUSIC

### Combine filters and paginate
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?category=TECH&city=Cluj-Napoca&from=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-31T23:59:59Z&page=0&size=5

### Get event details
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/1
